<title>USA: Novacare buys 24 outpatient businesses.</title>
<headline>Novacare buys 24 outpatient businesses.</headline>
<dateline>KING OF PRUSSIA, Pa. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>NovaCare Inc said Thursday it had acquired 24 outpatient physical therapy, occupational health and orthotic and prosthetic businesses with operations at 97 separate locations.</p>
<p>The acquisitions represent a total of $47 million in combined annual revenues.</p>
<p>The transactions closed in the quarter ended March 31, NovaCare said.</p>
<p>Terms of the transactions were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
